> 2026-07-25 +120
2026-07-25 + 120 days = 2026-11-22 (Sunday)

> 2026-07-25 -30
2026-07-25 - 30 days = 2026-06-25 (Thursday)

> 2026-12-31 +1
2026-12-31 + 1 days = 2027-01-01 (Friday)

> 2027-01-01 -1
2027-01-01 - 1 days = 2026-12-31 (Thursday)

> 2024-02-28 +1
2024-02-28 + 1 days = 2024-02-29 (Thursday)

> 2023-02-28 +1
2023-02-28 + 1 days = 2023-03-01 (Wednesday)

> --between 2026-01-01 2026-12-25
2026-01-01 .. 2026-12-25 = 358 days (51 weeks + 1 day)

> --between 2026-07-25 2026-07-26
2026-07-25 .. 2026-07-26 = 1 day (0 weeks + 1 day)

> --between 2026-07-26 2026-07-25
2026-07-26 .. 2026-07-25 = -1 days (-1 weeks + 6 days)

> --between 1900-01-01 2400-12-31
1900-01-01 .. 2400-12-31 = 182986 days (26140 weeks + 6 days)

> --leapday 2028
2028-02-29 (Tuesday)

> --leapday 2000
2000-02-29 (Tuesday)

> --syntax 2026-02-31
syntax ok: 2026-02-31 (not demanded)

> --syntax 2500-01-01
syntax ok: 2500-01-01 (not demanded)

> --help
ahccal - a calendar built on value constraints
  ahccal DATE                weekday, ordinal day, leap flag
  ahccal DATE [+-]N          add or subtract days
  ahccal --cal YEAR MONTH    month grid
  ahccal --between D1 D2     days between two dates
  ahccal --leapday YEAR      February 29th
  ahccal --zone OFF D HH:MM  UTC offset conversion (+ --dst)
  ahccal --syntax DATE       parse without demanding the date
  ahccal                     read commands from stdin

